  return (
    <div style={{ padding: 40 }}>
      <Input options={options} placeholder="Type to search..." />
    </div>
  );
}
```

**Notes:**
- Handles outside clicks, keyboard navigation, and large lists efficiently.
- Input border is red if the value is not in the options.
