When you apply a CSS `filter: blur()` to a container, all its children (including icons) will be blurred. To have only the card background/content blurred and keep the locker icon sharp, you need to separate the icon from the blurred area. Here are two common approaches:

**Option 1: Use a separate container for the icon**

**HTML:**
```html
<div class="info-card locked-card" id="card7">
  <div class="blurred-content">
    <div class="title">Locked</div>
    <div class="value">99</div>
  </div>
