</div>
```

**CSS:**
```css
.locked-card {
  position: relative;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.blurred-content {
  filter: blur(6px);
  padding: 16px;
}

.locker-icon {
  position: absolute;
  top: 10px;
  right: 10px;
